      "notes": "That's the thread through my work: agents let me make more things, and I want the result to carry enough evidence for someone else to inspect it. I'm still figuring out how much context is useful and when keeping it becomes more work than it saves. I'd love to hear what evidence you look for before trusting something an agent made. All the projects and this deck's editable source are linked here.",
